lowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":21,"created_at":"2025-05-20T09:14:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T08:41:20Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:32Z","assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssue with Godot v4.4, 4.4.1, and 4.5.dev (with built-in Jolt)\nRegression from 4.3 (with Jolt addon)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.19044 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7640) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n(This issue is a follow-up to #101721)\n\nThere exists a regression in how Jolt the addon detected ConcavePolygonShape3D in 4.3, versus how Jolt detects it since being embedded into core.\n\nI have two scenes that work as parametrized stair and ladder generators. They both use most of the same code, with the stairs generated as arranged StaticBody3Ds (with a BoxShape), and ladders generated as arranged CSGCylinders with collision enabled (therefore a ConcavePolygonShape3D). In addition to this, there is a ConcavePolygonShape3D StaticBody created on blender with a -col flag.\n\nI have created an Area3D that can move with arrow keys to overlap each of these objects.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70552008-df9e-4549-85b0-2b19583a8387)\n\nOn 4.3, the entry and exit of this body prints exactly one statement per interaction for both the ladder and the egg.\nSince 4.4, there's a great deal of spam for every frame of overlapping movement.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download the MRP.\n2. Open it on 4.3.\n3. Move the cylindrical Area3D with the arrow keys.\n4. Observe the expected single entry and exit signals for the egg and ladders in the output.\n5. Open project on 4.4 or later.\n6. Set physics engine to Godot Physics and restart.\n7. Run the game and observe the output working as expected.\n8. Change physics engine to \"Jolt Physics\" under Project Settings > Physics > 3D.\n9. Enable \"Areas Detect Static Bodies\" under Physics > Jolt Physics 3D\n10. Run the game observe the entry and exit spam in output.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[jolt-staticbody-egg-mrp-4.3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20337956/jolt-staticbody-egg-mrp-4.3.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106629/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}